== hline_of_a_frame
error[Z0401]: `hline` cannot be called on a Frame
 --> scripts/main.zeff:3:1
  |
3 | d.hline(at: 0)
  | ^ this is a Frame
  |
  = help: `hline` takes a Plot first; `x.hline(...)` is `hline(x, ...)`
